7.1 Project Overview
EduGenie – Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant is an AI-powered educational assistant that helps learners understand concepts, answer questions, generate quizzes, summarize content and obtain personalized learning paths.
7.2 Technologies Used
Python
FastAPI
Google Gemini API
LaMini-Flan-T5
HTML
CSS
Jinja2
Uvicorn
7.3 Project Outcomes
The project provides an interactive learning platform that combines AI capabilities with a simple web interface.
It supports:
Personalized learning
Quick question answering
Simplified explanations
Quiz-based practice
Quick revision through summaries
Structured learning recommendations
7.4 Challenges
The project document identifies challenges including:
Maintaining accuracy in AI-generated responses
Performance across devices
Balancing personalization with general usability
Prompt engineering
UI optimization
Data privacy considerations
